# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AUTH - Origin proof for cookie-based unsafe requests
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@OriginProofEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_MECHANIC_EMAIL}}
@OriginProofPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_MECHANIC_PASSWORD}}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [Setup][Origin] Login establishes auth cookies
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{OriginProofEmail}}",
  "password": "{{OriginProofPassword}}"
}

###

### [Positive][Origin] Safe authenticated validation does not require Origin
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/validate

###

### [Positive][Origin] Unsafe authenticated refresh accepts configured WebUI Origin
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Negative][Origin] Unsafe authenticated refresh rejects hostile Origin (403 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Origin: https://evil.example.test

###

### [Negative][Origin] Unsafe authenticated logout rejects missing Origin (403 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
